Z||000000||GTMike||07-31-2001||03:19 AM||||well i'm going to be doing a cold air intake.   pretty much like slammed has talked about.    so i went out to advance auto to find a filter,  but they didn't have the kind that can be clamped on to a tube. neither did autozone.     where would i find this  cone air filter that can be clamped on to   a 3 inche tube???||||reg||1
Z||000001||MinnGreenGT||07-31-2001||09:40 AM||||Check with the fiero store for "Fiero" model intakes & filters.  Otherwise just check with anyplace that deals with imports.  Even places like JC Whitney, Summit, and JEGs carry these types.  As to which model you need.  I'm still working on that one myself!<P>-Rob<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngt.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||DXR_DAD||07-31-2001||10:47 AM||||K&N makes different size & shapes of the cone type filter, 5" long - 8" long and round, square, oblong all with 3" connection to the tube. Design your tube/system first and then see what you need. I'm sure there are many that can be used.<P>Rob is right <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Jegs, Summit and any of the Import Shops<P>DXR_DAD||||reg||3
